{"name":"Traditional","hex":"#776255","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"traditional","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of, relating to, or derived from tradition. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","Communicated from ancestors to descendants orally."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["One with traditional beliefs.","Anything that is traditional, conventional, standard."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/traditional"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tradition","blocks":[{"text":"A tradition is a system of beliefs or behaviors passed down within a group of people or society with symbolic meaning or special significance with origins in the past. A component of cultural expressions and folklore, common examples include holidays or impractical but socially meaningful clothes, but the idea has also been applied to social norms and behaviors such as greetings. Traditions can persist and evolve for thousands of years. The word tradition itself derives from the Latin word tradere literally meaning to transmit, to hand over, to give for safekeeping. While it is reportedly assumed that traditions have an ancient history, many traditions have been invented on purpose, whether it be political or cultural, over short periods of time. Various academic disciplines also use the word in a variety of ways."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Tradition-Warner-Highsmith.jpeg/330px-Tradition-Warner-Highsmith.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tradition"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Indian_historical_Traditional_drama%28_In_stage_performance_-1%29.jpg/500px-Indian_historical_Traditional_drama%28_In_stage_performance_-1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Indian_historical_Traditional_drama%28_In_stage_performance_-1%29.jpg/1280px-Indian_historical_Traditional_drama%28_In_stage_performance_-1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Indian_historical_Traditional_drama%28_In_stage_performance_-1%29.jpg/500px-Indian_historical_Traditional_drama%28_In_stage_performance_-1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Traditional dress and arts, such as in  this performance of Traditional Hindi Drama -- the performance of tradition through folklore, reinforces the stories and memory reinforces the concept of tradition, and its importance in local communities.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AIndian_historical_Traditional_drama(_In_stage_performance_-1).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Tradisi_Unggahan_Bonokeling.jpg/500px-Tradisi_Unggahan_Bonokeling.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Tradisi_Unggahan_Bonokeling.jpg/1280px-Tradisi_Unggahan_Bonokeling.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Tradisi_Unggahan_Bonokeling.jpg/500px-Tradisi_Unggahan_Bonokeling.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A slametan tradition of a ritual proceeding before Ramadan to honor ancestors and Ramadan in Banyumas, Central Java, Indonesia","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATradisi_Unggahan_Bonokeling.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Wigilia_potrawy_76.jpg/500px-Wigilia_potrawy_76.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Wigilia_potrawy_76.jpg/1280px-Wigilia_potrawy_76.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Wigilia_potrawy_76.jpg/500px-Wigilia_potrawy_76.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Holiday celebrations may be passed down as traditions, as is the case with this distinctly Polish Christmas meal, decor with Christmas tree, a tradition since the late 18th and early 19th centuries.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWigilia_potrawy_76.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/GOOD_SHABBES_-.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/GOOD_SHABBES_-.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"A woman welcoming the Shabbat, a tradition dating back over 3,300 years","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGOOD_SHABBES_-.jpg"}],"sounds":{"traditional":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-traditional.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d0/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-traditional.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-traditional.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d0/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-traditional.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-traditional.wav.ogg"},{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-PerfectSoundWhatever-traditional.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7b/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-PerfectSoundWhatever-traditional.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-PerfectSoundWhatever-traditional